1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,285
Welcome to Agentic City, a city planning system for Hong Kong's Northern Metropolis.

2
00:00:06,285 --> 00:00:12,570
It brings city information, spatial planning, collaboration with agents, and plan assessment together

3
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:14,020
in one workspace.

4
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:19,615
The current map centres on the Lok Ma Chau Loop, San Tin and

5
00:00:19,615 --> 00:00:24,769
Ngau Tam Mei, and includes parts of Mai Po and Fairview Park. It

6
00:00:24,769 --> 00:00:29,924
covers about twenty-four point three square kilometres, divided into two hundred and eighty-nine

7
00:00:29,924 --> 00:00:35,078
planning zones. Twenty thousand, nine hundred and twenty-four existing buildings, together with roads,

8
00:00:35,078 --> 00:00:39,440
water and land-use records, provide a shared starting point for participants.

9
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:45,719
The two-dimensional map brings together city records, planning constraints and transport connections.

10
00:00:45,719 --> 00:00:51,558
Search an area to check land uses, permitted facilities and restrictions on

11
00:00:51,558 --> 00:00:57,397
demolition or pond filling. Green areas show buildable land. The network connects

12
00:00:57,397 --> 00:01:02,750
building locations and supports walking, cycling, driving and public transport analysis.

13
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:08,674
The three-dimensional view below shows the existing city and the spatial effects of

14
00:01:08,674 --> 00:01:14,147
your plan. New buildings, demolitions and road changes stay in sync with the

15
00:01:14,147 --> 00:01:19,621
two-dimensional records. Explore different views to understand building scale, surrounding conditions and transport

16
00:01:19,621 --> 00:01:23,410
connections, and see how your proposals change the city.

17
00:01:23,870 --> 00:01:29,364
The planning assistant lets you work with the city through natural language. Describe

18
00:01:29,364 --> 00:01:34,858
a planning goal, specify an area, set building requirements, or ask about city

19
00:01:34,858 --> 00:01:40,352
records and planning restrictions. The assistant brings this information together and turns your

20
00:01:40,352 --> 00:01:43,310
intentions into a concrete proposal for review.

21
00:01:43,750 --> 00:01:49,229
When an operation involves spending, the system presents the proposed work and its

22
00:01:49,229 --> 00:01:54,708
cost for approval before carrying it out. Construction, demolition, land preparation and policy

23
00:01:54,708 --> 00:02:00,187
commitments all draw on the same budget, making the resource implications of each

24
00:02:00,187 --> 00:02:01,030
decision clear.

25
00:02:01,500 --> 00:02:07,848
City planning goes beyond buildings and roads. In the Policy workspace, define a

26
00:02:07,848 --> 00:02:14,195
policy's objectives, eligible groups, geographic scope, funding and duration. This allows housing, employment

27
00:02:14,195 --> 00:02:18,590
and public-service policies to work alongside the spatial plan.

28
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:25,897
Assessment is organised into seven groups: housing and city capacity; mobility and accessibility;

29
00:02:25,897 --> 00:02:32,755
public-service capacity; safety and resilience; environment and climate; economy and employment; and exchange

30
00:02:32,755 --> 00:02:39,612
between Hong Kong and Shenzhen. Use the evaluation interface or ask the planning

31
00:02:39,612 --> 00:02:44,360
assistant to review the relevant indicators and scenario assumptions.

32
00:02:44,790 --> 00:02:50,468
In Model settings, configure your service URL and model name to bring your

33
00:02:50,468 --> 00:02:56,145
own model or agent framework into the planning workflow. City records, planning constraints

34
00:02:56,145 --> 00:03:01,823
and assessment methods provide the assistant's working context, supporting its understanding of tasks,

35
00:03:01,823 --> 00:03:04,880
development of proposals and use of tools.

36
00:03:05,330 --> 00:03:11,125
Agentic City connects city information, planning actions and spatial outcomes. It gives participants

37
00:03:11,125 --> 00:03:16,921
one environment in which to explore the city, develop a plan, check its

38
00:03:16,921 --> 00:03:19,150
performance and present their proposals.
